 "notes": "Constraint on axion decay constant (f_a) derived from analysis of 12 years of tritium decay data from JRC. The exclusion curve was extracted from Figure 3 by identifying the boundary of the red REDM region. Constraint is reported as 1/f_a versus axion mass m_a. The paper excludes f_a < 9.4\u00d710^12 GeV at low masses and f_a < 1.8\u00d710^10 GeV at high masses (1.7\u00d710^-21 to 8.7\u00d710^-21 eV range). This is a reinterpretation of existing nuclear decay data to constrain axion dark matter, not a new experimental measurement. Power-law scaling: 1/f_a \u221d m_a^3.83.",
